<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service"><article class="legal"><p class="eyebrow">Terms of Service</p><h1>Terms of Use</h1>
  <p class="muted">Effective: August 12, 2026 · Governing law: United States</p>
  <p>AliasMode is a free, open-source browser profile manager developed and operated by the Xreacher team. These terms govern your use of the AliasMode website, the AliasMode desktop application (&ldquo;the app&rdquo;), and the AliasMode Cloud synchronization service (&ldquo;AliasMode Cloud&rdquo;). By using AliasMode you agree to these terms, the <a href="/acceptable-use/">Acceptable Use Policy</a>, and the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Notice</a>.</p>
  <h2>Eligibility</h2>
