  <h2>Local and Cloud</h2>
  <p>AliasMode offers two ways to work. Local mode requires no AliasMode account, sends no traffic to AliasMode Cloud, and keeps profile data on the computer that uses it. Cloud mode uses a verified email address and password, gives each account one workspace with owner and member roles, and synchronizes encrypted portable profiles with a local cache.</p>
  <p>Product behavior can change as the service develops. Cloud features depend on an account, a workspace, and the current version of the product.</p>
