  <h2>Accounts and Cloud</h2>
  <p>If you create a Cloud account you are responsible for keeping your credentials secure and for the activity that happens under your account. Each account has one workspace with owner and member roles. Owners can manage workspace access, revoke devices, and use trash for deleted profiles.</p>
  <p>You are responsible for the profiles, content, and activity you bring to the product, including the lawful use of any accounts you manage with AliasMode.</p>
